Source code
-----------

The complete source code of BusyBox, iptables and musl used in the images is
attached to every GitHub release of this project, next to the images. The
release's "Source code" archive contains the build configuration used for
them (Dockerfile, busybox.fragment, scripts/). The source code of Tailscale
and of its Go modules is available from https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale
and https://pkg.go.dev.
